WEBVTT

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.150
Now, one and all.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.900
Show me a spectacle.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.900
You asked for it, Francine.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:12.910
Come, Pentagona Knocker.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.910
Give them a taste of your poison, Mamba.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.870
Lock them up in darkness, Schwarzes Tor.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:23.880
Hmm, I see the shiroganes mean business.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.130
I'll fight too.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:30.970
Sit this one out. You can't die yet.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:35.010
It's thanks to you
that we can fight now almost unharmed.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.720
Thanks to him? Don't make me laugh.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.640
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:44.650
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:48.980
And the gears turn

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:02.160
When the horn blows, the flames dance

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.830
The story waits for no-one

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:07.790
Off they go, the gears are churning

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:11.170
A red past chases after you

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:13.550
The jester's smile

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:16.390
What's behind the mask?

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:19.220
You can't erase the scars

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:22.060
No matter how they burn

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:24.940
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.980
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:33.780
Alone in the depths of the night

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:37.950
Let out a cry that can cut through fate

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.490
That's the cue to begin

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:43.830
The curtain is rising, it's time to dance

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:48.040
Everybody sheds tears at the end

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:51.170
So hold them in now and keep going

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:55.800
Until the day the curtain falls

00:01:55.970 --> 00:02:01.180
The gears will keep turning

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:10.570
#13 Lucille

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:14.030
I never asked that man
to help me.

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:18.320
What? He sacrificed himself
so we could be here.

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:19.660
You're wrong.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.700
We just let that show-off have his way.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.870
Besides, what can you do
with those wounds?

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:28.370
Don't be so vain.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.810
I heard them clear and well.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:49.900
But I'm not going to just stand back
and do nothing.

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.060
She's up there.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:54.320
I have to get there.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:58.240
Ooh, look what I found.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.120
Who's that trying to climb the stairs?

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:02.830
Narumi!

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:07.370
Dripping blood everywhere.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.670
How sexy.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.500
He looks ready to die any second now.

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:16.130
I should give him a helping hand.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.130
Or a coup de grâce!

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.800
Narumi, I can't let you die!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.600
The finale for Narumi!

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:26.220
What...?

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:30.980
You guys...

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:35.270
I get it now.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:40.700
We shiroganes have finally become one
after entering this tent.

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.160
I don't believe it.

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:49.040
The shiroganes all protected me.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:53.670
What's this?
I thought you didn't care about Narumi.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:58.300
It was the only way
to keep him from trying to fight.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:01.050
Right. We can't have him dying yet.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:05.970
Fools.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:11.020
Using your precious marionettes
to protect a half-dead man.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.980
Guys, don't worry about me.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:20.990
You take care of the four oldest.
I'll destroy Doll Francine!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.950
I know Narumi will do it for us.

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:26.120
-Narumi can.
-I know he can.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.620
We're counting on you, Narumi!

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:38.130
Who does he think he is,
trying to approach Lady Francine?

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.760
We won't let you.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.050
I'll stop him.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:43.300
Dammit.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:45.550
I'm so close...

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:49.430
Go, Narumi. I got your back.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:54.560
-Lina.
-I want to witness you destroy Francine.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:59.070
Why? I thought you shirogane-Os
wanted to do it yourselves.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:02.190
I'm not like the rest of them.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:05.240
I'm Lina. Malina.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:07.450
Move, woman.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.370
Oh, don't be so cold.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.830
Won't you dance with me?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:13.960
You're mine!

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:16.540
Dear me.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:20.710
Lina!

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:26.930
Narumi, the man who can defeat
automata with his bare hands.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.430
I wanted to fight you.

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:39.190
But it's useless.
You can't do anything now.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.710
The surviving automata are all running.

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:02.300
What's going on in there?

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:15.310
Teacher, we can reach them if we go down
this pole, right?

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:21.770
Yes, they prefer to keep Francine
in the center of the stage.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.860
Seems like my package made it in time.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.040
It's too bad, Narumi.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.500
Narumi!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.210
You fool, turning your back to your enemy.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.710
Les Mains Vertes Foncées.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:45.590
Rockenfield!

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.840
You're so weak, shiroganes.

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:54.220
I can't believe
we couldn't defeat you all this time.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.190
When did they...

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:08.200
Have we lost our chance to
destroy Doll Francine?

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:13.700
What's that?

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:21.170
That was quite an entrance, Lucille.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:25.960
The executioner always arrives last.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.760
I'm going to send you to join your family.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:34.050
I remember how red
your daughter's blood was.

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:39.730
It's no use trying to provoke me.

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:42.730
My blood is no longer red.

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:46.730
It's as dark as the night,
just like you lot.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.070
Time for your curtain call.

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:50.910
-Do it.
-Fire!

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:58.950
I-Impossible!

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.410
It can't be!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.960
Lady Francine!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:16.760
Bow down.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:33.660
Francine?

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:38.990
No, it's the legendary shirogane
who looked just like Francine.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.210
Lucille's daughter, Angelina.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.500
No... His heart...

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:50.840
There's still hope. Help me with him.

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:57.640
It's him.

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.850
It's not working. We have to try again.

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:06.150
But he's lost too much blood.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.900
Please, use my blood.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:11.610
Can't move?

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:18.410
Of course. Angelina looked exactly
like Doll Francine.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:22.660
And now her likeness
has ordered you to bow.

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:30.000
Now, time for a little chat
with an old acquaintance of mine.

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:32.170
Dottore.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:39.560
It's not Lady Francine...

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:42.560
Lady Francine is up there.

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:46.060
I can move... I can move...

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:50.650
Give it up. I've waited a long time
for this moment.

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:55.320
The moment I get to upbraid you
as you lie unable to move.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.530
Just like on that day.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:07.790
I've never known such humiliation!

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:14.800
Lady Francine, Dottore is about to
go crazy with anger!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:20.100
-I can't move.
-Yeah, I feel it too.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:25.980
The Aqua Vitae within us
is telling us to witness this battle.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:31.190
Is this so humiliating?
Then why don't you try this?

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:37.070
Just try and think that
Francine means nothing to you.

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:38.110
What?

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:41.580
The puppet that told you to bow down
is a fake.

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:46.160
You know that.
So why can't you move?

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.870
You might not understand,

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:52.590
but we humans call it
being bound by preconceptions.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:56.170
Ideas that have become fixed in your mind.

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:59.550
Like your fixation with
worshiping Doll Francine.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:02.300
So try this.

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:05.350
Think that Francine doesn't matter to you.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:09.060
I could never...!

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:13.570
You automata are such fools.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:18.570
Lucille! If he regains movement,
he'll kill you.

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:23.620
You have no right to despise us, Lucille.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:29.830
I know what you did to Angelina
after we ravaged your village.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:36.050
You used your daughter as bait
to lure us close.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:40.760
By implanting the soft stone
inside her body.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:46.220
That's right. I knew you were after
the soft stone.

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:52.230
So I had them retrieve
the remains of the stone from the well.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:56.230
But why?

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:59.360
The soft stone dissolves after 2 weeks,

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:03.410
no matter what kind of container
it's kept in.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:10.790
Except when it's placed in a human.
A human child, that is.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.880
Angelina worked as bait for us
numerous times.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:20.300
How hard it must've been. How painful.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:24.180
I did what no mother should ever do.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:27.640
My blood must be the cold color
of darkness.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:31.560
And you call yourself a human!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:34.560
It's better than being a puppet
like yourself.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.770
Move if you want to prove otherwise.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.570
Stop it!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:40.940
You're worried about me?

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.990
I thought you hated me.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.870
Of course I don't, you damned old maid!

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:50.500
I think you're amazing!

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:52.710
So Lucille, you can't...!

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:00.960
Have you made up your mind, Dottore?

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:05.180
You want to become human
with Aqua Vitae? Ridiculous.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:09.100
You'll always be Francine's
clockwork slave!

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:19.360
Francine is...

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.740
No, Dottore!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.860
You mustn't think that.

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:27.490
Francine is...

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:31.950
Nothing... Nothing to...

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:34.870
Nothing to me!

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:44.930
You poor fool, Dottore.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:50.310
You just said the one thing
you must never say.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:57.060
An automaton can't exist
without its reason for being.

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:01.020
It's over for you.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.280
Lucille!

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:16.790
What... What did I just say?

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:20.420
I...!

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.630
You fool, Dottore.

00:14:23.260 --> 00:14:27.180
Lady Francine is our sole raison d'être.

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:29.180
To deny that...

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:33.310
You've let go of the very reason
you can move.

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:43.650
Lucille, hang in there!
Let me take you to the medical capsule.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:46.950
I've lived long enough.

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:52.700
Don't say that. There are so many things
I still want to learn from you.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:57.330
Yes, but it seems like we're out of time.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:04.050
That's how life is.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.970
When we are born,

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:12.890
we are handed a white piece of paper
and a handful of colorful crayons.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:16.100
We're told to draw whatever we like.

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:17.850
But you know...

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.980
By the time you figure out
what you want to draw,

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.980
your time's up.

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:30.610
Your half-drawn paper and your crayons
are taken away from you.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:33.410
As for me...

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:37.750
I'd been busy coloring the edges black.

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:42.630
I wanted to draw a rabbit,
but before I knew it...

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:48.050
I'd run out of room.
There was no white space left.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.260
Lucille...

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:52.760
Don't cry, Mingxia.

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:55.810
Don't be like me.

00:15:56.270 --> 00:16:01.810
Draw a nice picture for yourself.
Don't let go of your crayons.

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:05.980
Draw your own picture.

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:23.670
What's your favorite food?

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.800
Lucille, when did you get here?

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:30.760
So, what is it?

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.680
Well, croquettes I guess.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.930
Really? I'll make some for you someday.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:40.980
Why are you so nice all of a sudden?

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:43.940
I am always nice.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:46.690
Now then.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.530
Going somewhere?

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:52.740
To my family.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.070
I've kept them waiting
for a long time now.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:02.460
Make sure you protect those dear to you.

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:05.630
And love them forever.

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.500
Hey, where are you going?

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.720
You'll go there too, someday.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.260
But it's too early for you yet.

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.510
Go on back now.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.940
The petrification is beginning.

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:33.280
Once it reaches his organs,
it'll be the end of him.

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:35.610
Minghai, Lucille!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:37.910
Minghai...

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.740
I won't forgive you if you die too!

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:44.710
I'll start the operation.
Mingxia, help me.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:49.380
Come on! This is our chance
to destroy Doll Francine.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.380
All right.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.260
Those automata can move? Why?

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.850
Because they're low-class.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:03.180
We four were created
by Lady Francine herself.

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.440
We're made like human beings.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:08.020
We have a strong sense of loyalty.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:11.400
But not those mass-produced automata.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:17.030
So they can move because their loyalty
to Lady Francine isn't as strong.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:21.620
But what irony.
Now they will secure our victory.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.090
Tor!

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:36.010
This is the end of me.

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:39.180
I bequeath my Schwarzes Tor to Narumi.

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:40.600
What do you mean?

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.060
Are you going to...?

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:47.940
Yes, you were the one that
implanted it for me, Professor.

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:54.190
So I could take as many automata
as possible with me when I died.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:57.700
-Mr. Tor!
-Timbavati, George, stand back!

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:03.540
She doesn't seem as beautiful to me
as she once did. Why?

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:09.080
Because a human who endured pain
and bled for the weak

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.710
shone more beautifully than her
in my eyes.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.130
I can die without regrets.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:36.530
A shirogane is headed towards
Lady Francine!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.530
We must move...

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:41.530
We have to find a way...

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.030
I can...

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:46.240
I can move!

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:47.790
All right!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:52.250
Just about. You two hurry up, too.

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:56.710
Dammit.

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.470
I remember what you said, Narumi.

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:03.050
That you just wanted to be yourself.

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:10.060
I want to be myself, too.

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:13.940
Colombine, you will find
your final rest here.

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:17.320
I'll hold you nice and tight.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:20.360
With my Les Mains Blanches Immaculées!

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.410
Mamba, Tower of Venomous Fangs!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:28.950
What a wonderful embrace.
But you're throwing your life away.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.540
Good work, I'll destroy Doll Francine!

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:35.460
I won't let you!

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:50.140
Nobody can reach Lady Francine now.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.560
Who knew Colombine had so much power?

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:02.820
You're being attacked by yourself,
how lame!

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:04.700
Is that what you think?

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:08.240
Tower of Venomous Fangs
is a self-sacrifice move.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:11.160
Mamba will drink my blood.

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:13.330
Guess what he'll do with it?

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.080
No...

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:21.130
Shirogane blood nullifies
your synthetic body fluids.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:24.430
For automata, it's pure poison.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.890
No, let go!

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:42.940
I'm melting... My face...

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:45.570
My body...

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:51.660
Was I able to be myself, too?

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:03.630
This sure is far from boring.

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:09.140
But what the heck's going to happen now?

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:31.910
Avoiding the crowds,
I walk in the dark

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:36.830
And wait with bated breath in the wings

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.460
My expression is calm
while I scream inside

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:46.380
On the verge of being torn apart

00:22:46.680 --> 00:22:51.300
I dance and beckon you to join me

00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:55.980
As a shadow swings
across the stage

00:22:56.180 --> 00:22:59.190
I tell myself this is
the last time

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:05.190
But I can't seem to
cut myself free

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:09.660
Too scared to stop for a moment

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:15.160
My impatience hides
the cries of somebody left behind

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:23.420
Nobody notices the shadow
standing in the sudden rain

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:31.590
Somewhere far away,
a memory of you is saying goodbye

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:39.390
I stand here watching,
no longer able to reach you
